t 350 words. Let's draft around 350. Need count. Let's write with placeholders: [Date], [Vendor Contact Name], [Vendor Company Name], [Your Name], [Your Company Name]? Company name is a name. Maybe [Your Company Name] is placeholder for name. But user says from a small software company; could use [Company Name]. Need only names and dates placeholders. So no [GPU Model], [Program Name]. Use \"your new GPU\" and \"developer program\".\n\nNeed ensure word count about 350. Let's draft and count.\n\nDear [Vendor Contact Name],\n\nI am writing on behalf of [Company Name], a small software company that develops an open-source inference engine for deploying machine learning models on heterogeneous hardware. We are requesting early access to the developer program for your new GPU.\n\nOur engine provides a lightweight runtime, model compiler, and deployment tooling that allow developers to run inference workloads with minimal configuration. Because the project is open source, it is used by a growing community of researchers, startups, and independent developers who need reliable performance across multiple hardware platforms. Early support for your GPU would help us provide a complete experience to users who are evaluating your hardware for production inference.\n\nAccess before launch is important to us because GPU support requires more than basic driver compatibility. We need time to validate memory", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0018714882899075747], [1421, -7.130136966705322]], [[1144, -9.417578439752106e-06], [1902, -12.170185089111328]], [[310, -0.34647136926651], [4087, -1.3157649040222168]], [[5707, -0.7419928908348083], [4087, -1.0424002408981323]], [[310, -4.768382950715022e-06], [303, -12.850022315979004]], [[1156, -2.2649790025752736e-06], [6163, -14.061868667602539]], [[25, -0.010399345308542252], [9859, -5.188469409942627]], [[328, -0.07417931407690048], [9357, -2.860231876373291]], [[7734, -3.314073182991706e-05], [2523, -10.966460227966309]], [[264, -3.552499765646644e